# BLTouch / clones (3D Touch, CR Touch). El wizard llena profile.probe.* con
# los pines del conector "PROBE" de tu placa -- confirma control_pin/sensor_pin
# contra tu board si usaste un adaptador o zocalo distinto al de fabrica.
[bltouch]
sensor_pin: ^{{ profile.probe.pin }}
control_pin: {{ profile.probe.servo_pin }}
x_offset: {{ profile.probe.x_offset | default(0) }}
y_offset: {{ profile.probe.y_offset | default(0) }}
z_offset: {{ profile.probe.z_offset | default(0) }}
speed: 5
samples: 2
sample_retract_dist: 3.0
stow_on_each_sample: True

[safe_z_home]
# home_xy_position asume una cama ~235x235; ajustalo al centro real de tu cama.
home_xy_position: 117, 117
speed: 100
z_hop: 10
